   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "This is my first real interview ever, for a summer internship. What should I bring?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Bring a couple of printed copies of your resume, a notebook and a pen. And a few questions you want to ask.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Do I need a portfolio or anything?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.38,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Only if the role is creative or technical. A class project you're proud of can be a good thing to show.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The water bill's double this month. Paisley, did you see it?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "block": "nq_work_008",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_work_008",
   "name_pos": "middle",
   "addressee": "Paisley"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "other",
   "text": "I saw it and closed the envelope.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "block": "nq_work_008"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I built a small app for a class",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.76,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "but it's kind of basic.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.82,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's still worth mentioning. Explain what problem it solved and what you learned building it.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
